<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Biblica® Open Akuapem Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">1 Tesalonikafo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paulo Nhoma A Edi Kan A Ɔkyerɛw Kɔmaa Tesalonikafo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tesalonikafo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Te</para>
  <para style="mt2">Paulo Nhoma A Edi Kan A</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔkyerɛw Kɔmaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonikafo</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>Saa nhoma yi fi Paulo, Silas ne Timoteo nkyɛn,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TH 1:1"/>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Wɔde kɔma Tesalonika asafo a wɔyɛ Agya Onyankopɔn ne Awurade Yesu Kristo mma no:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TH 1:1"/>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Adom ne asomdwoe nka mo.<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s1">Aseda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Daa yɛda Onyankopɔn ase ma mo, na yɛkae mo wɔ yɛn mpaebɔ mu nso. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Efisɛ yɛkae mo gyidi a mode di dwuma, mo dɔ a ɛma mutumi de nsi yɛ adwuma ne mo anidaso dennen a mowɔ wɔ yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo mu no wɔ yɛn Nyankopɔn ne Agya no anim.<verse eid="1TH 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Anuanom, yenim sɛ Onyankopɔn dɔ mo nti na wayi mo sɛ ɔno ankasa ne de no. <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>Sɛ yɛbɛkaa Asɛmpa no kyerɛɛ mo a, ɛnyɛ nsɛm bi kwa, na mmom yegyina tumi ne Honhom Kronkron ne mu nokware mu gyidi so. Munim nnipa ko a na yɛyɛ ɛne sɛnea yɛboaa mo fae. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Musuasuaa yɛn ne Awurade; ɛwɔ mu sɛ muhuu amane de, nanso mode anigye a efi Honhom Kronkron no mu gyee asɛm no. <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Ɛnam so ma mobɛyɛɛ nhwɛso maa agyidifo a wɔwɔ Makedonia ne Hela nyinaa. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Nsɛm a moka faa Awurade ho no ankɔ Makedonia ne Hela nko, na mmom gyidi a mowɔ wɔ Onyankopɔn mu no ho asɛm adu baabiara. Asɛm biara nni hɔ a ɛsɛ sɛ yɛka bio. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Obiara kamfo sɛnea mugyee yɛn ne sɛnea motwee mo ho fii abosom ho kɔsom nokware Nyankopɔn a ɔte ase daa no, <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>na motwɛn ne Ba a ofi ɔsoro no; Yesu a onyan no fii awufo mu a ogye yɛn fi Onyankopɔn abufuw a ɛreba no mu no.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Adwumayɛ Wɔ Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Anuanom, mo ankasa munim sɛ sra a yɛbɛsraa mo no anyɛ ɔkwa. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Munim ayayade a wɔyɛɛ yɛn ne ɔyaw a wɔyaw yɛn wɔ Filipi ansa na yɛreba mo nkyɛn wɔ Tesalonika no. Ɛwɔ mu sɛ na nnipa bi tia yɛn de, nanso yɛn Nyankopɔn hyɛɛ yɛn den ma yɛkaa Asɛmpa a efi ne mu no. <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Asɛmpa a yɛka kyerɛɛ mo no mfi adwemmɔne anaa nnaadaa mu, na mmom, nea yɛkae no yɛ nokware turodoo. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Daa yɛka nokware, sɛnea Onyankopɔn hwehwɛ yɛn sɛ yɛnka no, efisɛ ɔpene so na ɔde Asɛmpa no nso ama yɛn sɛ yɛnka. Yɛmpɛ sɛ yɛsɔ nnipa ani, na mmom Onyankopɔn a ɔsɔ yɛn adwene hwɛ no ani na yɛpɛ sɛ yɛsɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Munim pefee sɛ yɛamma ha sɛ yɛrebɛka nnaadaasɛm akyerɛ mo anaasɛ yɛde sikanibere rebɛkata yɛn ani akasa. Onyankopɔn ne yɛn danseni. <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Sɛ moyɛ Kristo asomafo no nti, anka yɛwɔ ho kwan sɛ yɛpɛ anuonyam fi mo nkyɛn, nanso yemmisaa anuonyam mfii mo anaasɛ onipa foforo bi nkyɛn ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>Yɛwɔ mo nkyɛn no, na yɛne mo te odwo so, sɛnea ɔbeatan kokɔ ne mma. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Yɛhwɛɛ mo yiye, nyaa mo ho anigye sononko; mpo yɛdaa yɛn ho so sɛ yɛde yɛn nkwa bɛto hɔ ama mo, bere a yɛde Onyankopɔn Asɛmpa no brɛɛ mo no. <verse eid="1TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Anuanom, minim sɛ mokae adwuma a yɛyɛɛ ne brɛ a yɛbrɛe. Yɛyɛɛ adwuma awia ne anadwo; sɛnea Onyankopɔn Asɛmpa no ka na yɛka kyerɛɛ mo no, yɛremfa ɔhaw bi mmɛto mo so. <verse eid="1TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Mo ne Onyankopɔn yɛ yɛn nnansefo. Yɛn suban a yɛdaa no adi kyerɛɛ mo a mugyee Asɛmpa no dii no yɛ kronkron a eye na mfomso biara nni ho. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Mo ara munim sɛ yɛne mo tenaa sɛnea agya ne nʼankasa mma tena. <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>Yɛhyɛɛ mo nkuran; yɛkyekyee mo werɛ na yɛkɔɔ so tuu mo fo sɛ montena ase wɔ ɔkwan a ɛsɔ Onyankopɔn a ɔfrɛ mo wɔ nʼahenni ne nʼanuonyam mu no so.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Daa yɛbɛda Onyankopɔn ase wɔ saa asɛm yi ho. Bere a yɛkaa Onyankopɔn asɛm kyerɛɛ mo no, mutie gye dii sɛ ɛnyɛ asɛm a efi onipa nkyɛn, na mmom ampa ara sɛ efi Onyankopɔn nkyɛn. Mo a moagye adi no Onyankopɔn yɛ adwuma wɔ mo mu. <verse eid="1TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Anuanom, nsɛm a ɛtotoo Onyankopɔn asafo a na ɛwowɔ Yudea ne nnipa a wɔwɔ hɔ a na wɔyɛ Kristo Yesu nkurɔfo no bi ara na ato mo yi. Ɔtaa a mo ara mo manfo taa mo no bi na Yudafo a <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>wokum Awurade Yesu ne adiyifo no de taa yɛn nso. Onyankopɔn ani nsɔ wɔn, na wɔne nnipa di asi bere biara. <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Wɔbɔ mmɔden sɛ wobesiw yɛn kwan, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a yɛrentumi nkɔka asɛm a ɛbɛma amanamanmufo no nkwagye nkyerɛ wɔn. Eyi maa wɔn bɔne kɔɔ so daa. Na Onyankopɔn abufuw wɔ wɔn so.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Pɛ Sɛ Ɔkɔsra Wɔn Bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Anuanom, yɛantumi amma mo nkyɛn wɔ bere tiaa bi mu, nanso bere biara na yɛdwene mo ho. Yɛpɛɛ sɛ yehu mo, na yɛbɔɔ mmɔden biara sɛ yebehyia mo ankasa. <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Yɛpɛɛ sɛ yɛbɛsan aba mo nkyɛn. Me Paulo de, na mepɛ sɛ meba hɔ boro pɛnkoro nanso ɔbonsam siw yɛn ho kwan. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Nanso dɛn ne yɛn anidaso, anigye, anaa ahenkyɛw a ɛbɛma yɛn anuonyam wɔ Awurade Yesu anim bere a ɔbɛsan aba no? Ɛnyɛ mo ana? <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Nokware ni, yɛn ahohoahoa ne yɛn ahosɛpɛw gyina mo so.<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɛmpa A Efi Timoteo Nkyɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Akyiri yi a yehuu sɛ yɛyɛ ho hwee a ɛnyɛ yie no, yɛyɛɛ yɛn adwene sɛ yɛbɛtena Atene. <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>Enti yɛsomaa yɛn nua Timoteo a yɛne no yɛ Onyankopɔn adwuma no sɛ ɔnkɔka Asɛmpa a ɛfa Kristo ho mfa mmoa nhyɛ mo gyidi den, <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a ɔtaa no nti mo mu biara remmɔ hu. Mo ara munim sɛ saa ɔtaa no yɛ Onyankopɔn pɛ a wahyehyɛ ama yɛn. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Bere a na yɛne mo wɔ hɔ no, yedii kan ka kyerɛɛ mo se wɔbɛtaa yɛn; na sɛnea munim no na aba mu saa pɛpɛɛpɛ no. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Eyi nti esiane sɛ na asɛm no hyɛ me so nti, mesomaa Timoteo se ɔmmɛhwɛ sɛnea mo gyidi te. Mewɔ anidaso sɛ ɔbonsam ansɔ mo anhwɛ amma dwuma a yɛadi no nyinaa anyɛ ɔkwa.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Afei, Timoteo afi mo nkyɛn aba yɛn nkyɛn abɛka anigyesɛm a ɛfa mo gyidi ne mo dɔ ho asɛm akyerɛ yɛn. Waka akyerɛ yɛn se, daa modwene yɛn ho adwene pa na mopɛ sɛ muhu yɛn, sɛnea yɛn nso yɛpɛ sɛ yehu mo no ara pɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Enti yɛn haw ne yɛn amanehunu no mu no, moahyɛ yɛn nkuran, <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>efisɛ sɛ mugyina pintinn wɔ Awurade mu a, na ɛma yɛn nso yetumi gyina biribiara ano wɔ yɛn asetena mu. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛda Onyankopɔn ase ma mo. Mo nti, yɛda Onyankopɔn ase sɛ moama yɛn ho asɛpɛw yɛn wɔ nʼanim. <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Daa awia ne anadwo, yefi yɛn koma nyinaa mu srɛ no sɛ, ɔmma yɛne mo nhyia na yɛmma mo nea ehia mo wɔ mo gyidi mu.<verse eid="1TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Ɔno ara yɛn Nyankopɔn ne Agya no ankasa ne yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo nsiesie ɔkwan na yɛmmra mo nkyɛn. <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Awurade mma mo dɔ mu nyɛ den mmoro so wɔ mo ho mo ho ne afoforo mu, sɛnea yɛn nso yɛdɔ mo no. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Mebɔ mpae sɛ Awurade ne ne nkurɔfo nyinaa ba a, ɔbɛma mo koma mu ayɛ kronkron a nkekae biara nni mu wɔ Agya Nyankopɔn anim.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Asetena A Ɛsɔ Onyankopɔn Ani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Anuanom, asɛm a etwa to ne sɛ musuaa ɔkwan pa a ɛsɛ sɛ mofa so tena ase a ɛbɛsɔ Onyankopɔn ani. Na saa pɛpɛɛpɛ na morebɔ mo bra. Enti yɛde yɛn Awurade Yesu din srɛ, hyɛ mo sɛ monyɛ mma ɛmmoro nea moreyɛ mprempren no so. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Munim nkyerɛkyerɛ a esiane Awurade Yesu tumi nti, yetumi kyerɛkyerɛɛ mo.<verse eid="1TH 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Eyi yɛ Onyankopɔn pɛ a ɔwɔ ma mo. Ɔpɛ sɛ moyɛ kronkron na motwe mo ho fi aguamammɔ ho. <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ musua sɛnea mohyɛ mo ho so na obiara atumi ne ne yere atena wɔ kronkronyɛ ne anuonyam mu. <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>Monntena ase akɔnnɔ anibere so te sɛ abosonsomfo a wonnim Onyankopɔn no. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Onyankopɔn akyide no bi nso ne sɛ, ɛnsɛ sɛ mo mu biara sisi ne yɔnko, efisɛ sɛ obi yɛ saa a, Onyankopɔn bɛtwe nʼaso denneennen sɛnea yɛadi kan abɔ mo kɔkɔ no. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Onyankopɔn amfrɛ yɛn se yɛmmɛbɔ aguaman, na mmom ɔfrɛɛ yɛn se yɛntena ase ahotew mu. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Ɛno nti, obiara a ɔbɛpo saa nkyerɛkyerɛ yi no mpo onipa, na mmom ɔpo Onyankopɔn a ɔma mo ne Honhom Kronkron no.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Ɛho nhia sɛ mɛkyerɛw mo afa ɔdɔ a ɛsɛ sɛ modɔ mo nuanom asuafo no ho. Onyankopɔn akyerɛ mo ankasa ɔkwan a ɛsɛ sɛ mofa so dodɔ mo ho mo ho. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Na moada saa ɔdɔ no adi pɛpɛɛpɛ akyerɛ anuanom a wɔwɔ Makedonia no nyinaa. Nanso anuanom, yɛsrɛ mo sɛ monkɔ so nnodɔ mo ho mo ho mma ɛmmoro saa. <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Momma ɛnyɛ mo botae sɛ mobɛtena ase dinn na moahwɛ so adi mo dwuma de abɔ mo ho akɔnhama sɛnea yɛaka akyerɛ mo dedaw no. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Sɛ moyɛ saa a ɛbɛma wɔn a wɔnyɛ asuafo no afɛre mo na moremmisa nea ehia mo nso mfi obiara nkyɛn.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awurade Ba No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Anuanom, yɛpɛ sɛ yɛka nokware a ɛfa wɔn a wɔawuwu no ho kyerɛ mo, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a morenni ho awerɛhow te sɛ wɔn a wonni anidaso no. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Yegye di sɛ Yesu wui, na ɔsɔree bio. Enti sɛ Onyankopɔn de Yesu ba bio a, ɔde wɔn a wonyaa ne mu gyidi ansa na wɔrewu no bɛka ne ho aba. <verse eid="1TH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Awurade nkyerɛkyerɛ a yɛreka akyerɛ mo no ne se, da a Awurade bɛba no, yɛn a yɛte ase yi renni awufo no anim kan. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Awurade no ankasa de ɔhyɛ a ano yɛ den, ɔbɔfo panyin nteɛmu ne Onyankopɔn torobɛnto nnyigye fi ɔsoro bɛba fam. Wɔn a wɔawuwu wɔ Kristo mu no bɛsɔre kan, <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>na wɔaboaboa yɛn a yɛte ase bere no ne wɔn a wɔasɔre no ano wɔ omununkum mu ahyia Awurade wɔ wim. Na saa na yɛne Awurade bɛtena daa. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Enti momfa saa asɛm yi nkyekye obiara werɛ.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Munsiesie Mo Ho Mma Awurade Ba No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Anuanom, ɛho nhia sɛ mɛkyerɛw akyerɛ mo nna ne bere a saa nsɛm yi besisi. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Efisɛ mo ankasa munim yiye sɛ da a Awurade bɛba no bɛyɛ sɛ ɔkorɔmfo a ɔreba anadwo. <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Bere a nnipa bɛka se, “Biribiara yɛ asomdwoe” no, saa bere no na adesɛe bɛba wɔn so. Na wɔrentumi nguan. Ɛbɛyɛ te sɛ yaw a ɛba ɔpemfo a ɔrewo so no.<verse eid="1TH 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Nanso mo anuanom yi de, monte sum mu nti ɛnsɛ sɛ saa da no fu mo mu sɛ ɔkorɔmfo. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Mo nyinaa moyɛ hann ne adekyee mma. Yɛnyɛ anadwo ne sum mma. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Ɛno nti, ɛnsɛ sɛ yɛdeda sɛ afoforo no. Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛwɛn na yɛbrɛ yɛn ho ase. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Anadwo na nnipa da. Anadwo na nnipa bow nsa. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Nanso yɛyɛ adekyee mma nti, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛbrɛ yɛn ho ase. Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛhyɛ gyidi ne ɔdɔ nkatabo ne yɛn nkwagye anidaso sɛ dade kyɛw. <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Onyankopɔn anyi yɛn sɛ yemmehu amane wɔ nʼabufuw ano, na mmom oyii yɛn sɛ yebenya nkwagye wɔ Awurade Yesu Kristo mu. <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>Kristo wu maa yɛn, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a sɛ yɛanyan oo, anaa sɛ yɛawu oo, yɛne no bɛtena ase wɔ nkwa mu. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Esiane saa nti, monhyɛ mo ho nkuran na mommoaboa mo ho mo ho sɛnea mugu so reyɛ yi.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Afotu Ne Nkradi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Anuanom, yɛsrɛ mo sɛ momfa obu ne nidi mma wɔn a Awurade ayi wɔn sɛ wonni mo anim nkyerɛkyerɛ mo no. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Esiane adwuma a wɔyɛ no nti, mummu wɔn na monnɔ wɔn yiye. Montena ase asomdwoe mu. <verse eid="1TH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Anuanom, yɛhyɛ mo sɛ monkasa nkyerɛ anihawfo, monka wɔn a wɔnyɛ hyew no hyew; mommoa wɔn a wɔyɛ mmerɛw; montɔ mo bo ase mma wɔn nyinaa. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Monhwɛ sɛ obi mmfa bɔne a obi ayɛ no no ho ka ntua no. Bere biara momma ɛnyɛ mo botae sɛ mobɛyɛ papa ama mo ho mo ho ne obiara.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Momma mo ani nnye da biara <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>na bere biara nso, mommɔ mpae; <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>biribiara mu, monna ase. Eyi na Onyankopɔn hwehwɛ afi mo nkyɛn wɔ Kristo Yesu mu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Monnka Honhom Kronkron no nhyɛ; <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>munnsi adiyisɛm atwetwe. <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>Monsɔ biribiara nhwɛ; momfa nea eye. <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>Na munkyi bɔne biara.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Na ɔno asomdwoe Nyankopɔn no ara ntew mo ho koraa, na ɔnhwɛ mo honhom ne mo kra ne mo nipadua so a ɛho remma asɛm biara kosi sɛ yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo bɛba. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Ɔnokwafo ne nea ɔfrɛɛ mo no, ɔno nso na ɔbɛyɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Anuanom, mommɔ mpae mma yɛn.<verse eid="1TH 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Momfa mfewano kronkron nkyiakyia anuanom nyinaa.<verse eid="1TH 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Mehyɛ mo wɔ Awurade tumi mu se monkenkan saa nhoma yi nkyerɛ anuanom no nyinaa.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo adom nka mo.<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
